<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7165" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπείρω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pierce through, fix on a spit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλάγχνα δ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἀμπείραντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.426
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν᾽ ἀναπείρω τὰς κίχλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1007
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐπὶ τὸν ὀβελίσκον ἀναπαρῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					835a18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>impale,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ξύλου ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.103
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποθανεῖν ἀναπαρείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ . . τὸν πόδ᾽ ἀναπαρῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Macho
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.349c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pierce upwards,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπείρω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.10.1
			</span></i>.</div>
